WEBVTT

00:00:12.670 --> 00:00:14.790
Mr. Principal, who is this...?

00:00:14.790 --> 00:00:17.460
Well, it's a cat, as you can plainly see.

00:00:17.460 --> 00:00:18.540
Okay...

00:00:18.790 --> 00:00:21.790
It comes to hang out every once in a while.

00:00:21.790 --> 00:00:23.500
Adorable, isn't it?

00:00:24.210 --> 00:00:25.250
Sure.

00:00:25.250 --> 00:00:27.210
Anyway, you had something
to talk with me about?

00:00:27.210 --> 00:00:28.000
Yes.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:30.830
There's a new transfer student coming today
and they're going to be in your cla-

00:00:35.040 --> 00:00:36.790
Wh-what is happening?!

00:00:51.830 --> 00:00:53.500
Sorry for the wait!

00:00:53.500 --> 00:00:56.540
I had a hard time getting this outfit on
and it made me run pretty late!

00:00:56.670 --> 00:00:58.250
Aw jeez, you're the transfer student?!

00:01:01.380 --> 00:01:03.920
Hey, Lum! I can't fit through the door!

00:01:03.920 --> 00:01:05.420
What's the dealio?

00:01:06.080 --> 00:01:08.920
Ah, howdy there! Sorry for keeping ya!

00:01:11.080 --> 00:01:14.080
Well, despite my long tenure as a teacher,

00:01:14.080 --> 00:01:17.670
I'm afraid that I've never been responsible
for teaching an alien before.

00:01:17.670 --> 00:01:19.290
I'm just not sure I'm a good fit for the job...

00:01:19.750 --> 00:01:21.420
Get outta here with that hogwash!

00:01:21.420 --> 00:01:23.670
Ya got nothing to worry about!

00:01:23.670 --> 00:01:26.540
My daughter's a little genius
and well-mannered to boot!

00:01:26.540 --> 00:01:29.580
She won't be causing ya
any problems whatsoever!

00:01:29.580 --> 00:01:32.130
So, I hope you'll treat her well.

00:01:32.130 --> 00:01:34.330
I look forward to learning
under your tutelage, sir!

00:01:36.670 --> 00:01:37.830
Well...

00:01:37.830 --> 00:01:40.790
I know you're all excited about
school recreation day,

00:01:40.790 --> 00:01:43.670
but before we get to that, I have a
new transfer student to introduce.

00:01:43.670 --> 00:01:44.830
Whoa, a new kid?!

00:01:44.830 --> 00:01:45.330
Who could it be?

00:01:45.330 --> 00:01:45.920
Transfer student, huh?
Who could it be?<b></b>

00:01:45.920 --> 00:01:46.920
Transfer student, huh?
Is it a boy? Or a girl?!<b></b>

00:01:46.920 --> 00:01:47.790
Is it a boy? Or a girl?!

00:01:50.000 --> 00:01:50.830
Darling!

00:01:50.830 --> 00:01:51.830
Lum?!
It's Lum!<b></b>

00:01:52.960 --> 00:01:55.920
Oh, darling! Now I'm officially
a student at your school!

00:01:55.920 --> 00:01:58.830
You must have transferred here
to be closer with me, right?

00:01:58.830 --> 00:01:59.750
That's so sweet of you.

00:01:59.750 --> 00:02:01.130
Oh shut your face!

00:02:01.580 --> 00:02:03.130
What do you think, darling?

00:02:03.130 --> 00:02:04.880
Do I look great in this outfit or what?

00:02:04.880 --> 00:02:07.540
You look cute as button, Lum!

00:02:07.830 --> 00:02:10.080
Wah... wahfur...!

00:02:10.630 --> 00:02:12.330
S-Shinobu...

00:02:12.580 --> 00:02:14.960
Wahfur... wazer... watur...
What's the matter, Ataru?<b></b>

00:02:14.960 --> 00:02:15.880
Wahfur... wazer... watur...
Where are you trying to go, Moroboshi?<b></b>

00:02:15.880 --> 00:02:17.080
Where are you trying to go, Moroboshi?

00:02:18.000 --> 00:02:19.000
Darling?!

00:02:20.630 --> 00:02:22.250
Are you playing dead or something?

00:03:53.830 --> 00:03:57.920
Attention all 2nd-year students,
it's time for recreation day to begin.

00:03:58.170 --> 00:04:00.580
Please assemble in the school yard.

00:03:59.540 --> 00:04:01.880
<b>Transfer Student</b>

00:03:59.540 --> 00:04:01.880
<b>Close Call...</b>

00:04:00.580 --> 00:04:02.460
Executive committee members

00:04:02.460 --> 00:04:03.880
I'm gonna do my best!
should meet at the main tent.<b></b>

00:04:03.880 --> 00:04:04.670
should meet at the main tent.

00:04:04.790 --> 00:04:07.580
Hey, man. Do you know what event
Lum is participating in?

00:04:07.580 --> 00:04:08.710
This blows.

00:04:09.000 --> 00:04:11.380
Stupid Lum transferring here is
totally gonna cramp my style.

00:04:11.380 --> 00:04:13.040
Hi darling!

00:04:14.880 --> 00:04:17.210
Whoa! I spy another hot babe out in the crowd!

00:04:17.210 --> 00:04:18.210
Did you say hot babe?!

00:04:18.210 --> 00:04:21.540
I heard the class next door got their
own transfer student recently.

00:04:21.540 --> 00:04:22.960
Let's go see for ourselves!

00:04:23.130 --> 00:04:25.000
What events are you two going to compete in?

00:04:25.000 --> 00:04:27.460
Tee-hee! I'm doing
the scavenger hunt race!

00:04:27.460 --> 00:04:28.880
I'll be in the foot race!

00:04:35.330 --> 00:04:36.170
Why hello there!

00:04:36.170 --> 00:04:38.500
What's your name, sweet thing?
Which class are you in?

00:04:38.500 --> 00:04:40.580
Hey Ran, do you know this guy?

00:04:41.540 --> 00:04:43.210
Ran, huh! That's a cute name!

00:04:43.210 --> 00:04:45.670
I'm Ataru Moroboshi.
Great to meet you!

00:04:46.040 --> 00:04:48.130
So hey, wanna go out for drinks sometime?

00:04:51.880 --> 00:04:53.540
Darling! Quit with the flirting!

00:04:53.540 --> 00:04:55.750
You're supposed to be
cheering me on today!

00:04:55.750 --> 00:04:57.920
Catch you later, Ran!

00:04:57.920 --> 00:04:59.790
You sweet thing!

00:05:01.500 --> 00:05:03.500
Really? You've never met him before?

00:05:04.750 --> 00:05:07.630
It's almost time. Good luck with
