00:05:07.630 --> 00:05:10.000
Gosh, but I'm such a slow runner...

00:05:15.380 --> 00:05:18.500
Oh yeah, that girl over there
just transferred in today.

00:05:18.500 --> 00:05:20.250
I heard she's an alien from space!

00:05:20.250 --> 00:05:22.920
An alien?! That's crazy!

00:05:24.750 --> 00:05:27.540
It's time to get started!
Everybody line up!

00:05:27.710 --> 00:05:28.540
Let's go!

00:05:28.540 --> 00:05:29.380
'Kay!

00:05:31.250 --> 00:05:33.000
You and I need to have a chat.

00:05:33.000 --> 00:05:35.380
Meet me behind the gym later, got it?

00:05:39.380 --> 00:05:41.330
What's the matter, Ran?

00:05:41.330 --> 00:05:43.630
She just told me to meet her
behind the gym later!

00:05:43.630 --> 00:05:44.960
Why would she do that?

00:05:44.960 --> 00:05:46.290
You haven't met her before, right?

00:05:46.500 --> 00:05:48.540
She seems kinda scary!

00:05:48.540 --> 00:05:50.290
Want us to go with you?

00:05:50.290 --> 00:05:52.210
No. I'll be okay!

00:05:58.500 --> 00:05:59.710
I'm up here.

00:06:02.130 --> 00:06:03.170
Hey Ran!

00:06:03.250 --> 00:06:04.210
<b>SMILE</b>

00:06:04.290 --> 00:06:05.500
<b>SMILE</b>

00:06:07.040 --> 00:06:08.290
Lumy-poo!

00:06:08.290 --> 00:06:09.750
Aw, Ran!

00:06:10.130 --> 00:06:12.540
Wow, it's been forever!

00:06:12.540 --> 00:06:15.130
Shucks, I thought my disguise
had everybody fooled.

00:06:15.130 --> 00:06:17.080
I knew it was you right away!

00:06:17.080 --> 00:06:18.630
I mean, we've been friends
since we were little!

00:06:19.170 --> 00:06:22.710
But I gotta say, that cutesy act
you're putting on is kinda creepy.

00:06:22.710 --> 00:06:24.080
Why not just be the real you?

00:06:24.080 --> 00:06:27.040
Oh gosh. Well, the problem is
it's hard for me to revert back

00:06:27.040 --> 00:06:28.960
once I put myself out there!

00:06:28.960 --> 00:06:31.080
Okay then. Whatever works for you!

00:06:31.080 --> 00:06:32.790
I'm so sowwy!

00:06:33.000 --> 00:06:34.170
Anyway, what's up?

00:06:34.170 --> 00:06:36.000
Did you come all the way here to see me?

00:06:36.000 --> 00:06:37.380
You bet I did!

00:06:37.380 --> 00:06:39.670
Oh yeah? But you didn't need to
come to this high school

00:06:39.670 --> 00:06:41.330
disguised as a human to do that.

00:06:41.630 --> 00:06:43.460
Actually, it was super important!

00:06:44.210 --> 00:06:46.790
So, like, I was going through this old album.

00:06:46.790 --> 00:06:50.040
It was full of pictures from when
we played together as kids!

00:06:50.460 --> 00:06:52.540
We had a lot of fun, remember?

00:06:52.790 --> 00:06:54.330
Now that takes me back!

00:06:54.330 --> 00:06:57.290
Seeing them made a lot of old memories
start coming back to me.

00:06:57.500 --> 00:06:59.250
Like for example...

00:06:59.250 --> 00:07:02.540
when we both fell in love with
this total hunk of a guy.

00:07:03.080 --> 00:07:06.170
Oh... I guess something
like that happened.

00:07:06.170 --> 00:07:07.330
Come on, silly!

00:07:07.330 --> 00:07:09.380
There's no way that you forgot about it!

00:07:09.380 --> 00:07:11.880
Gosh... he was such a stud!

00:07:12.630 --> 00:07:14.750
His name was Rei, right?

00:07:15.500 --> 00:07:18.290
But in the end, you went and
got engaged to him.

00:07:18.290 --> 00:07:20.710
That was so long ago,
it's ancient history!

00:07:21.960 --> 00:07:24.290
Once I remembered that fiasco...

00:07:24.290 --> 00:07:25.290
I...

00:07:25.540 --> 00:07:28.290
started feeling really heartbroken!

00:07:28.830 --> 00:07:30.500
Aw, but Ran...

00:07:31.420 --> 00:07:32.750
SHUT THE HELL UP!

00:07:32.750 --> 00:07:34.580
AND DROP THE BUDDY-BUDDY ACT!

00:07:34.580 --> 00:07:35.080
Huh?!

00:07:35.080 --> 00:07:37.750
Listen! I came here to
get revenge on you!

00:07:38.040 --> 00:07:41.670
So screw all this sappy bullshit
about old friends and fond memories!

00:07:41.670 --> 00:07:43.040
Huh? Revenge?

00:07:43.380 --> 00:07:46.000
Yeah! I'm gonna steal your man
and make him all mine!

00:07:46.000 --> 00:07:47.380
You WHAT?!

00:07:47.380 --> 00:07:50.540
That's right! Then I'm gonna
suck the youth right outta him!

00:07:50.830 --> 00:07:51.960
Remember my power?

00:07:51.960 --> 00:07:54.960
I can drain the life energy
from people by using my lips!

00:07:54.960 --> 00:07:56.710
I'm not letting you near my darling!

00:07:56.710 --> 00:07:57.670
Listen, Lum!

00:07:57.670 --> 00:08:00.000
Keep your stupid mouth shut
about me being an alien!

00:08:00.000 --> 00:08:01.750
I gotta stay in disguise
to move around freely!

00:08:01.750 --> 00:08:03.130
Not gonna happen!

00:08:03.130 --> 00:08:04.130
Fine then.

00:08:04.130 --> 00:08:06.330
I'll just tell everyone about the time
that you slept over at my place

00:08:06.330 --> 00:08:07.790
and wet the bed!

00:08:08.420 --> 00:08:10.460
But that was when were kids!

00:08:11.420 --> 00:08:12.540
Time to go public.

00:08:12.540 --> 00:08:13.500
Wait right there!

00:08:13.500 --> 00:08:16.540
Okay. Just keep quiet about me
and I won't spill the beans.

00:08:18.920 --> 00:08:21.630
Hey Ran! The event's about to start!

00:08:22.920 --> 00:08:24.880
'Kay! I'll be right there!

00:08:25.130 --> 00:08:26.290
That's the deal.

00:08:26.290 --> 00:08:27.920
Keep your promise, Lumy-poo!

00:08:28.130 --> 00:08:30.210
Bye! I've got places to be.

00:08:34.130 --> 00:08:36.750
So, Ran... what did you two talk about?

00:08:36.750 --> 00:08:39.710
The idea of meeting someone
behind the gym freaks me out.

00:08:40.040 --> 00:08:41.460
Oh totally!

00:08:41.460 --> 00:08:43.670
Eek, it was super scary!

00:08:44.000 --> 00:08:46.500
