Hold on a minute!<b></b>

00:10:15.710 --> 00:10:15.920
I have to stop my darling from getting near her!

00:10:15.920 --> 00:10:17.170
Hey there, sweet thing!
I have to stop my darling from getting near her!<b></b>

00:10:17.170 --> 00:10:18.580
Just ignore the peanut gallery over there.
I have to stop my darling from getting near her!<b></b>

