C'mon! Let's get going!

00:10:24.170 --> 00:10:26.330
Huh? But the finish line is the other way...

00:10:26.750 --> 00:10:27.790
Forget about that.

00:10:30.670 --> 00:10:32.290
Uh, what's the deal?

00:10:32.290 --> 00:10:34.130
Why did you bring me over here?

00:10:35.290 --> 00:10:37.290
