<b>KAPOW!</b>

00:10:57.170 --> 00:10:58.540
Not on my watch!

00:10:58.540 --> 00:11:00.790
Why you sunnuva...!

00:11:01.000 --> 00:11:04.250
Next up, it's the cavalry battle!

00:11:04.580 --> 00:11:07.920
Let me make one thing clear.
SHE came onto ME, okay?

00:11:07.920 --> 00:11:10.630
Whatever, just keep your distance from Ran!

00:11:10.630 --> 00:11:11.880
Like hell I will!

00:11:11.880 --> 00:11:13.710
Ran definitely has the hots for me!

00:11:14.170 --> 00:11:16.460
Eek! This is so scary!

00:11:16.630 --> 00:11:17.380
Don't worry!

00:11:17.380 --> 00:11:18.130
We've got you!

00:11:18.130 --> 00:11:19.130
You're safe!

00:11:20.080 --> 00:11:21.040
<b>STOMP STOMP</b>

00:11:21.040 --> 00:11:22.000
<b>STOMP STOMP</b>

00:11:22.170 --> 00:11:23.420
Outta the way!

00:11:23.420 --> 00:11:24.830
Take this!

00:11:27.540 --> 00:11:29.080
I found Ran!

00:11:29.460 --> 00:11:29.880
Ran, my loooooooooove!

00:11:29.880 --> 00:11:31.710
W-whoa! Ataru!
Ran, my loooooooooove!<b></b>

00:11:31.710 --> 00:11:33.580
Don't do it, darling!

00:11:33.580 --> 00:11:35.380
You have to stay away from her!

00:11:35.380 --> 00:11:36.210
Ran, baby!
You have to stay away from her!<b></b>

00:11:36.210 --> 00:11:37.080
Ran, baby!

00:11:37.080 --> 00:11:38.130
Oh, Mr. Ataru!

00:11:38.330 --> 00:11:39.330
Hey sweet thing!

00:11:39.330 --> 00:11:40.540
Dumb darling!

00:11:42.790 --> 00:11:43.830
<b>WOBBLE</b>

00:11:44.000 --> 00:11:46.250
It's time for round two!

00:11:47.080 --> 00:11:49.830
Smoooooch!

00:11:51.080 --> 00:11:52.380
Quit it, dude!

00:11:52.380 --> 00:11:54.250
We're in the middle of
