most wonderful husband!

00:13:31.830 --> 00:13:34.080
Those were good times!

00:13:35.130 --> 00:13:39.130
But after all that, Rei went and
fell in love with you in the end...

00:13:40.670 --> 00:13:42.880
Getting all your damn wishes granted.

00:13:42.880 --> 00:13:44.630
Life is always so unfair.

00:13:44.630 --> 00:13:46.500
Everything goes your way no matter what!

00:13:46.500 --> 00:13:47.670
Now that I think about it,

00:13:47.670 --> 00:13:50.330
Rei only had eyes for YOU
even back when we were kids!

00:13:50.330 --> 00:13:51.460
Uh, Ran?

00:13:51.460 --> 00:13:53.500
YOU STUPID SHITHEAD!

00:13:53.500 --> 00:13:57.580
I'm gonna take that darling of yours
and turn him into mincemeat!

00:13:57.580 --> 00:14:00.170
The whole reason I came here
is to make your life hell!

00:14:00.170 --> 00:14:02.000
Get ready to suffer!

00:14:02.000 --> 00:14:03.580
LUUUUUM!

00:14:11.000 --> 00:14:14.960
<b>Dear Lumy-poo,</b>

00:14:11.000 --> 00:14:14.960
<b>Let's meet under the tree in the back</b>

00:14:11.000 --> 00:14:14.960
<b>of the school during lunch break.</b>

00:14:11.000 --> 00:14:14.960
<b>I have something important to tell you,</b>

00:14:11.000 --> 00:14:14.960
<b>so please be sure to come.</b>

00:14:11.000 --> 00:14:14.960
<b>From Ran</b>

00:14:15.250 --> 00:14:17.540
Why would she want to meet here?

00:14:17.540 --> 00:14:20.580
Ran is definitely up to no good again.

00:14:20.830 --> 00:14:22.880
Lumy-poo! Lumy-poo!

00:14:23.500 --> 00:14:24.830
Is that you, Ran?

00:14:27.290 --> 00:14:28.790
Huh? Is this a robot?

00:14:28.790 --> 00:14:31.000
I'm going back to my home planet.

00:14:31.000 --> 00:14:33.500
But I thought you were here
to get revenge on me?

00:14:33.500 --> 00:14:35.960
I've totally given up on that idea.

00:14:35.960 --> 00:14:38.040
Sniffle, sniffle. Sniffle, sniffle.

00:14:38.040 --> 00:14:39.540
What's the matter?

00:14:39.540 --> 00:14:42.790
I just don't want you to hate me, Lumy-poo.

00:14:42.790 --> 00:14:44.920
Aw, Ran! You finally came around?

00:14:44.920 --> 00:14:46.080
So, since I'm leaving...

00:14:46.080 --> 00:14:49.670
I'm going to be holding
a farewell party this Sunday.

00:14:49.670 --> 00:14:51.920
Be sure to bring your darling with you!

00:14:51.920 --> 00:14:53.290
Wait, why him?

00:14:53.290 --> 00:14:57.170
But don't tell him anything
about me going back home.

00:14:57.170 --> 00:14:58.580
It's just too sad.

00:14:58.580 --> 00:15:00.920
Please trust me, Lumy-poo!

00:15:01.290 --> 00:15:03.960
All I want is to spend my last
precious moments on Earth

00:15:03.960 --> 00:15:05.790
together with you and your darling!

00:15:05.790 --> 00:15:06.790
Huh?

00:15:06.790 --> 00:15:07.750
Message end.

00:15:07.750 --> 00:15:10.380
This robot will self-destruct in 3 seconds.

00:15:20.580 --> 00:15:23.880
<b>Map to the farewell party</b>

00:15:20.580 --> 00:15:23.880
<b>Ran's house</b>

00:15:24.170 --> 00:15:26.170
It's around here somewhere.

00:15:26.580 --> 00:15:30.630
<b>Farewell Party</b>

00:15:26.580 --> 00:15:30.630
<b>Close Call...</b>

00:15:31.080 --> 00:15:32.920
This must be the place.

00:15:36.960 --> 00:15:38.580
Her house looks like a UFO!

00:15:38.580 --> 00:15:40.580
You think so, too, darling?

00:15:40.580 --> 00:15:42.420
I was just thinking the same thing!

00:15:42.630 --> 00:15:43.630
Boing!

00:15:46.080 --> 00:15:48.580
Hello and welcome to my humble abode!

00:15:49.500 --> 00:15:51.630
Please come in and have a seat!

00:15:51.630 --> 00:15:53.830
This room is super cute!

00:15:53.830 --> 00:15:56.000
Oh, by the way, I brought
a little something for you!

00:15:56.000 --> 00:15:57.380
Oh! How pretty!

00:15:57.380 --> 00:15:59.080
I'll find a spot to display them right now!

00:16:01.330 --> 00:16:02.830
Here you go, Mr. Vase.

00:16:03.460 --> 00:16:05.080
Omigosh! You can't eat them!

00:16:05.080 --> 00:16:05.920
Chomp.

00:16:06.290 --> 00:16:08.580
That's enough now, you little scamp.

00:16:09.170 --> 00:16:11.170
I said knock it the hell off!

00:16:11.170 --> 00:16:13.000
Huh? What's the matter, Ran?

00:16:13.330 --> 00:16:14.920
It's nothing!

00:16:17.170 --> 00:16:18.710
Guess who made cookies?

00:16:18.710 --> 00:16:20.000
Here you are, darling.

00:16:20.000 --> 00:16:21.380
And for, Lumy-poo.

00:16:21.380 --> 00:16:23.170
Go ahead and eat up!

00:16:23.580 --> 00:16:25.880
These must be laced with
a tranquillizer or something...

00:16:25.880 --> 00:16:27.580
I'll totally eat them if you don't.

00:16:27.580 --> 00:16:28.750
O-oh really?

00:16:28.750 --> 00:16:30.880
Hold on, darling! You can have mine!

00:16:30.880 --> 00:16:32.750
Please try some, Lumy-poo!

00:16:32.750 --> 00:16:35.210
They're super yummy, I swear!

00:16:40.460 --> 00:16:42.460
Ah! The cake must be done!

00:16:42.460 --> 00:16:43.920
I'm going to go check on it.

00:16:48.750 --> 00:16:50.000
What're you doing, Lum?

00:16:50.210 --> 00:16:50.960
<b>SWIP!</b>

00:16:51.580 --> 00:16:52.710
<b>RATTLE</b>

00:16:53.170 --> 00:16:54.790
<b>MUNCH</b>

00:16:53.170 --> 00:16:54.790
<b>MUNCH</b>

00:16:55.630 --> 00:16:57.250
That's one freaky vase.

00:17:02.920 --> 00:17:04.460
I knew it.

00:17:04.880 --> 00:17:06.670
Time for cake!

00:17:13.960 --> 00:17:16.000
So, did you enjoy the cookies?

00:17:16.000 --> 00:17:18.500
Oh yeah, they were
eyewateringly delicious!

00:17:18.500 --> 00:17:19.710
You silly billy!

00:17:19.710 --> 00:17:21.880
I think you meant to say "mouthwatering".

00:17:21.880 --> 00:17:22.920
That's right!

00:17:22.920 --> 00:17:24.750
Well, guess I'll go wash these plates!

00:17:24.750 --> 00:17:27.250
Heavens no! You're my guest,
so just take it easy.

00:17:27.250 --> 00:17:29.960
But I'd feel bad making you
do all the work, Ran!

00:17:29.960 --> 00:17:31.790
Yeah! Just let Lum do it!

00:17:31.790 --> 00:17:33.460
Be back soon!

00:17:36.000 --> 00:17:37.750
I know she's gonna try and
seduce my darling

00:17:37.750 --> 00:17:40.000
the minute I leave them alone!

00:17:40.460 --> 00:17:41.630
C'mon, baby!

00:17:41.630 --> 00:17:43.290
Wh-what?

00:17:43.290 --> 00:17:45.130
Hurry, while Lum isn't looking!

00:17:45.130 --> 00:17:45.960
Huh?!

00:17:47.080 --> 00:17:48.540
Ran, my love...

00:17:48.540 --> 00:17:50.170
J-just hold on a second.

00:17:50.170 --> 00:17:51.960
You really shouldn't be cheating on Lum.

00:17:52.960 --> 00:17:54.540
D-don't be like that!

00:17:54.540 --> 00:17:56.880
You didn't have a problem with it before!

00:17:56.880 --> 00:17:58.580
This is our chance to elope!

00:17:58.580 --> 00:18:00.580
Nuh-uh! No way!

00:18:01.040 --> 00:18:05.170
Darling! I'm gonna give you a good licking
with my iron club when we get home!

00:18:05.170 --> 00:18:06.040
Aw c'mon! Ran, baby!

00:18:06.040 --> 00:18:07.630
Lum sure is taking her time!
Aw c'mon! Ran, baby!<b></b>

00:18:07.630 --> 00:18:09.380
Let me go check on her.

00:18:14.790 --> 00:18:16.670
Oh, Lumy-poo! Sorry about this!

00:18:16.670 --> 00:18:18.830
It's okay! I'm just a slow washer.

00:18:19.670 --> 00:18:22.500
Oh dear. The oven seems a little too hot...

00:18:23.460 --> 00:18:25.210
What are you making?

00:18:25.210 --> 00:18:26.880
Something extra special!

00:18:26.880 --> 00:18:28.670
What does that mean?

00:18:28.670 --> 00:18:32.290
Oh, forget about it. You need to
hurry back to your darling!

00:18:32.290 --> 00:18:33.750
R-right...

00:18:38.750 --> 00:18:40.080
I can't tell...

00:18:40.080 --> 00:18:43.630
Has Ran really given up
on taking my darling?

00:18:44.500 --> 00:18:46.670
Darling! Sorry to keep you!

00:18:49.170 --> 00:18:51.080
Huh? Darling?

00:18:55.130 --> 00:18:57.790
Uh oh, he must have went off
to explore on his own.

00:18:57.790 --> 00:18:59.960
I'm totally lost.

00:19:00.920 --> 00:19:03.750
I gotta say, this isn't like
any house I've seen before.

00:19:05.880 --> 00:19:07.710
Here we go!

00:19:10.460 --> 00:19:12.830
He's perfect! A complete copy of Ataru!

00:19:12.830 --> 00:19:14.250
Ran, we have a problem!

00:19:14.540 --> 00:19:15.540
What is it?

00:19:18.580 --> 00:19:20.130
My darling went off somewhere!

00:19:20.130 --> 00:19:22.210
Oh no! Well, don't worry too much!

00:19:22.460 --> 00:19:23.670
It's me!

00:19:24.170 --> 00:19:24.920
Woop!

00:19:24.920 --> 00:19:25.790
Woop.

00:19:25.790 --> 00:19:26.630
Woop!

00:19:26.630 --> 00:19:27.380
Woop.

00:19:30.130 --> 00:19:31.040
Zoom!

00:19:31.500 --> 00:19:33.080
What's the deal with this guy?

00:19:35.580 --> 00:19:36.670
What is that?

00:19:41.710 --> 00:19:44.170
See? He was right here the whole time!

00:19:44.670 --> 00:19:46.670
Darling! You shouldn't go
wandering around

00:19:46.670 --> 00:19:48.250
other people's houses like that!

00:19:49.250 --> 00:19:51.790
Especially Ran's, because it's
full of dangerous stuff!

00:19:51.790 --> 00:19:52.960
We're going home right now!

00:19:52.960 --> 00:19:54.790
The swap went off without a hitch!

00:19:56.750 --> 00:19:59.630
Now all I have to do is
kiss the real one!

00:20:02.210 --> 00:20:03.790
There you are, darling!

00:20:03.790 --> 00:20:05.750
I was wondering where you got off to.

00:20:06.250 --> 00:20:08.880
Lum just said she was going home, so...

00:20:09.460 --> 00:20:13.000
<b>SUUUUUUUCK</b>

00:20:11.540 --> 00:20:13.000
Come on, let's go!

00:20:13.130 --> 00:20:15.880
No! I don't wanna leave!

00:20:19.540 --> 00:20:23.460
WHEN THE HELL DID THEY
GET SWITCHED, DAMMIT?!
I ain't going! Ran, baby! Wait for me!<b>
Enough! You better do what I say, mister!</b>

00:20:23.460 --> 00:20:24.750
I ain't going! Ran, baby! Wait for me!
Enough! You better do what I say, mister!<b></b>

00:20:25.750 --> 00:20:28.670
I wonder if Ran is back on her
home planet already...

00:20:29.420 --> 00:20:30.920
We used to be such good friends.

00:20:30.920 --> 00:20:33.540
I really should have tried to
get along with her more.

00:20:33.540 --> 00:20:36.790
Now I feel bad for
doubting her the whole time.

00:20:44.420 --> 00:20:45.420
What?!

00:20:45.790 --> 00:20:46.920
Ran?!

00:20:46.920 --> 00:20:48.380
I thought you left to go back home!

00:20:49.290 --> 00:20:50.710
In your friggin' dreams!

00:20:50.710 --> 00:20:53.330
I'm not done getting my
revenge on you yet, dammit!

00:20:53.330 --> 00:20:54.130
Huh?!

00:20:54.130 --> 00:20:55.880
Hmph! How stupid.

00:20:55.880 --> 00:20:57.630
She's totally got her head up her ass.

00:20:57.630 --> 00:21:01.420
You know... Ran's personality
is really hard to figure out.

00:22:36.750 --> 00:22:40.250
GROOOOOOWWRR!

00:22:41.130 --> 00:22:43.460
Lum...

00:22:45.540 --> 00:22:50.330
<b>To Kill with Love</b>

00:22:45.540 --> 00:22:50.330
<b>Studying Mayhem</b>

00:22:45.710 --> 00:22:47.920
On the next episode of Urusei Yatsura!

00:22:47.920 --> 00:22:49.460
GROOWWRR!
